            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-500/30 text-amber-300 border border-amber-400/40 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i>
                Platform Alat Utilitas Digital Terpadu
            </span>

            <a href="#"
               onclick="openDonateModal(); return false;"
               class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-500/30 text-amber-300 border border-amber-400/40 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg cursor-pointer hover:bg-amber-500/40 transition">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i>
                Dukung Kami
            </a>

            <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-tight drop-shadow-md">
                Efisiensi Pekerjaan Anda dengan <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-300 to-amber-500">RumahTools</span>
            </h1>

            <p class="text-base sm:text-xl text-slate-100 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-normal leading-relaxed drop-shadow">
                Kelola konversi dokumen, generator kode, hingga sistem pembayaran Virtual Account dalam satu tempat kerja yang terorganisir.
            </p>

            <!-- Scroll Indicator -->
            <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 text-slate-200 text-xs font-medium animate-bounce drop-shadow">
                <span>Gulir ke bawah untuk melihat fitur</span>
                <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-amber-400"></i>
            </div>
        </div>
